    <title>oppo_intern_w</title>
    <link href="https://frolen88.github.io/2025/03/15/oppo-intern-w/"/>
    <id>https://frolen88.github.io/2025/03/15/oppo-intern-w/</id>
    <published>2025-03-15T11:19:55.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-03-15T11:22:03.657Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>题型：20道单选+3道编程</p><h2 id="单选"><a href="#单选" class="headerlink" title="单选"></a>单选</h2><ol><li><p>java，c++代码分析题</p></li><li><p>sql语句执行，分析结果</p></li><li><p>java，c++的语法问题，什么java8的编程规范</p></li><li><p>计网似乎只有一道，http缓存的作用</p></li><li><p>绝大部分好像都是分析程序执行结果</p></li></ol><h2 id="编程题"><a href="#编程题" class="headerlink" title="编程题"></a>编程题</h2><ol><li>第一题，算个总和，减去两倍的当前数即可</li><li>第二题，hash，注意输入超时</li><li>第三题，状态机dp，一个长数字，消失掉其中一些，有多少种填法可以使得是3的倍数，不能存在前导0</li></ol><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">import java.util.*;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">// 注意类名必须为 Main, 不要有任何 package xxx 信息</span><br><span class="line">public class Main &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    public static void main(String[] args) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        Scanner in = new Scanner(System.in);</span><br><span class="line">        // 注意 hasNext 和 hasNextLine 的区别</span><br><span class="line">        long n = in.nextInt();</span><br><span class="line">        String s = in.next();</span><br><span class="line">        long mod = 1_000_000_007;</span><br><span class="line">        char[] chars = s.toCharArray();</span><br><span class="line">        long[] dp = new long[3];</span><br><span class="line">        long sumPart = 0;</span><br><span class="line">        long len = 0;</span><br><span class="line">        for (int i = 0; i &lt; chars.length; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            if (chars[i] != &#x27;?&#x27;) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                sumPart += chars[i] - &#x27;0&#x27;;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125; else &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                len++;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        dp[(int) (sumPart % 3)] = 1;</span><br><span class="line">       // 简单处理一下存在前导零的问题，懒得改代码了</span><br><span class="line">        if (chars[0] == &#x27;?&#x27;) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            len--;</span><br><span class="line">            long[] tmp = new long[3];</span><br><span class="line">            for (long j = 1; j &lt; 10; j++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                int x = (int) ((j - &#x27;0&#x27;) % 3);</span><br><span class="line">                for (int k = 0; k &lt; 3; k++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                    tmp[k] += dp[(k - x + 3) % 3];</span><br><span class="line">                    tmp[k] %= mod;</span><br><span class="line">                &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            dp = tmp;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        for (int i = 0; i &lt; len; i++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            long[] tmp = new long[3];</span><br><span class="line">            for (long j = 0; j &lt; 10; j++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                int x = (int) ((j - &#x27;0&#x27;) % 3);</span><br><span class="line">                for (int k = 0; k &lt; 3; k++) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">                    tmp[k] += dp[(k - x + 3) % 3];</span><br><span class="line">                    tmp[k] %= mod;</span><br><span class="line">                &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            dp = tmp;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        System.out.println(dp[0]);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
