  <entry>
    <title>二分查找</title>
    <link href="https://frolen88.github.io/2025/02/10/binarySearch/"/>
    <id>https://frolen88.github.io/2025/02/10/binarySearch/</id>
    <published>2025-02-10T06:26:13.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-02-16T12:38:56.530Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>之前每次写二分查找的时候都需要思考很久。主要思考的问题分为两个，第一就是left和right到底怎么变化，第二就是最后输出什么作为最后的结果。<a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AP41137w7/?vd_source=ea351c852539b2b0449f514ba2472bbd">灵神的视频中通过左右开闭区间的方式</a>，讲述了二分查找相关的一些写法，看完之后恍然大悟，同时也在视频中也说明了对于二分查找相关的一些转化。这里主要就记录在leetcode刷题过程中对于相关思路和方法的运用总结，便于在之后翻找。</p><figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 左右闭区间</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">binarySearch</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span>[] nums, <span class="type">int</span> target)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">left</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">0</span>, right = nums.length - <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (left &lt;= right) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">mid</span> <span class="operator">=</span> left + (right - left) / <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (nums[mid] &gt;= target) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            right = mid - <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            left = mid + <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 循环不变量</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// left - 1:小于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// right + 1: 大于等于target(假设num.length为无穷)</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 需求:输出&gt;=target的index</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 最后的结果是right&lt;left，因此最后需要输出的是right+1，但由于最后right+1=left，因此可以输出left</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> left;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 左闭右开</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">binarySearch1</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span>[] nums, <span class="type">int</span> target)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">left</span> <span class="operator">=</span> <span class="number">0</span>, right = nums.length;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (left &lt; right) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">mid</span> <span class="operator">=</span> left + (right - left) / <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (nums[mid] &gt;= target) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            right = mid;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            left = mid + <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 循环不变量</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// left - 1:小于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// right: 大于等于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 需求:输出&gt;=target的index</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 最后的结果是right==left，因此最后需要输出的是right</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> right;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 左开右闭</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 但这个东西应该是存在错误的，相比左闭右开。因为当只有两个元素，且mid指向的元素小于target时，left会永远等于mid，而导致最终死循环。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 在考虑(mid+1)/2的情况应该就是对的了，因为需要将mid值放到(left,right]区间中。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">binarySearch3</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span>[] nums, <span class="type">int</span> target)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">left</span> <span class="operator">=</span> -<span class="number">1</span>, right = nums.length - <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (left &lt; right) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">mid</span> <span class="operator">=</span> left + (right - left) / <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (nums[mid] &gt;= target) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            right = mid - <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            left = mid;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 循环不变量</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// left:小于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// right + 1: 大于等于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 需求:输出&gt;=target的index</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 最后的结果是right==left，因此最后需要输出的是right + 1</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> right + <span class="number">1</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 左右开区间</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="type">int</span> <span class="title function_">binarySearch2</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">int</span>[] nums, <span class="type">int</span> target)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">left</span> <span class="operator">=</span> -<span class="number">1</span>, right = nums.length;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span> (left &lt; right - <span class="number">1</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> <span class="variable">mid</span> <span class="operator">=</span> left + (right - left) / <span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> (nums[mid] &gt;= target) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            right = mid;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">else</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            left = mid;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 循环不变量</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// left:小于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// right: 大于等于target</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 需求:输出&gt;=target的index</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 最后的结果是right - 1 == left，因此最后需要输出的是right</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> right;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>对于正整数$a,b$存在以下的等式。<script type="math/tex">\lceil \frac{a}{b} \rceil=\lfloor \frac{a+b-1}{b} \rfloor=\lfloor \frac{a-1}{b}+1 \rfloor</script></p><p><a href="https://leetcode.cn/problems/minimum-speed-to-arrive-on-time/description/">二分答案时，针对浮点数的处理</a></p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">二分查找学习与总结</summary>
    
    
    
    
