  <entry>
    <title>Java学习(二)</title>
    <link href="https://frolen88.github.io/2025/01/07/JavaKnowledge/"/>
    <id>https://frolen88.github.io/2025/01/07/JavaKnowledge/</id>
    <published>2025-01-07T12:01:01.000Z</published>
    <updated>2025-01-07T15:30:04.431Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<hr><h3 id="多态"><a href="#多态" class="headerlink" title="多态"></a>多态</h3><p>一句话简单总结多态中成员变量和成员方法的调用特点。调用成员变量：<strong>编译看左边，运行也看左边</strong>。调用成员方法：<strong>编译看左边，运行看右边</strong>。</p><hr><h3 id="成员内部类"><a href="#成员内部类" class="headerlink" title="成员内部类"></a>成员内部类</h3><ol><li><p>针对成员内部类如何获取外部类的成员变量。<a href="https://github.com/frolen88/JavaCoding/blob/d9d831118e34ee46ec91997beb7ab5884a8d65ef/src/test_inner_class/CaptureOuterMemberVariable.java">代码链接</a></p><p>具体分析的原因可以看到如图一种红色框所显示，因为内部类中会有一个变量指向外部类的对象this$0(在代码中使用Outer.this进行调用)。这也是为什么在代码中修改outer.a后，inner.show能够反映出改变。</p><p><img src="\pic\JVMinnerClass.png" alt="图一：内部类的内存结果"></p></li></ol><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">public class CaptureOuterMemberVariable &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    public static void main(String[] args) &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        Outer outer = new Outer();</span><br><span class="line">        Outer.Inner inner = outer.new Inner();</span><br><span class="line">        inner.show();</span><br><span class="line">        outer.a = 4;</span><br><span class="line">        inner.show();</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">class Outer&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    int a = 1;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    class Inner&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        private int a = 2;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">        void show() &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            int a = 3;</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(Outer.this.a);   // 1    4</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(this.a);         // 2    2</span><br><span class="line">            System.out.println(a);              // 3    3</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol><li><strong>外部类和内部类分为两个不同的文件加入到方法区中</strong>。</li></ol><p><img src="\pic\innerClass.png" alt="图二：内部类和外部类分开加入方法区证明"></p>]]></content>
    
    
    <summary type="html">主要针对一下多态中的知识和内部类中的知识。</summary>
    
    
    
